# The August 2026 pre-CRAN review record (briefs, reports, findings) is
# tracked so the review is versioned and visible to every clone.
!dev/review-2026-08/
/paper/

# Tracked, but excluded from the tarball by .Rbuildignore (see the entries
# there). These are durable package assets, not development scratch, so they
# live at the top level rather than under dev/:
#   certification/  block-Gibbs gold references + route certificates. They
#                   anchor the Z-ratio surface accuracy claims and cost hours
#                   of compute to regenerate.
#   data-raw/       generators for the material vignettes, which ship as .rds.
#                   A baked vignette number without its generator is a number
#                   with no provenance.
#   baselines/      bitwise SBC reference summaries. Re-baselined whenever a
#                   patch changes an FP arithmetic route.

# testthat problem artefacts
tests/testthat/_problems/
tests/testthat/testthat-problems.rds

# Local tooling
.claude/
renv/

# Baseline snapshot copies made before re-baselining runs -- scratch, not assets
baselines/*.bak_*
baselines/*.pre_perf_*
